  "ruleText": "Med 105.01 Meetings. The board shall meet monthly and at such additional times as shall be called for by the president or by vote of the board.\n\nSource. #4970, eff 11-8-90, EXPIRED 11-8-96\n\nNew. #6554, eff 7-31-97",
